{{!--
Octestra task agent prompt.
This is a sample template; customize it for your repository.

Available variables:
- skillName: configured Codex skill name
- target: task target file, when configured
- epicPrompt: combined epic and task prompts
- issueNumber: task issue number
- pullNumber: linked pull request number, when available
- draftFlag: `--draft` when draft pull requests are configured
--}}
Use /{{skillName}} to complete the following task.

{{#if target}}
Target file: {{target}}
{{/if}}

{{epicPrompt}}

Include the following line in the pull request description:
Closes #{{issueNumber}}

Create the pull request with `gh pr create {{draftFlag}}`.
